# Solaceon Town's east house (decomp scripts_solaceon_town_east_house.s, docs/research/seals.md §4.1): the mother gives
# the Seal Case and five random seals (a Heart, two Stars, a Foamy, a Song: give_or_take_seal with get_random), then the
# boy, shown a party Unown A, gives ten A Seals (seal 50). The Bag's Seal Case says "Seals: 15". The save keeps them.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 20 platinum:MOVE_WING_ATTACK
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_UNOWN 10
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SOLACEON_TOWN_EAST_HOUSE 2 6 up
until idle
+0 assert state sealCase.counts[49] 0
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state flags["platinum:FLAG_RECEIVED_SOLACEON_TOWN_EAST_HOUSE_SEAL_CASE"] true
+0 assert state bag.key_items[0].item "platinum:ITEM_SEAL_CASE"
+0 assert app none
# The boy (5, 5)
+0 press down
until position 2 7 600
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 5 7 600
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 5 6 600
+0 release up
+0 press up
+2 release up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state sealCase.counts[49] 10
+0 assert app none
# The Bag's Seal Case: "Seals: 15".
+0 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:7
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert text platinum:Bag_Text_SealCaseMessage 0 0=15
+1 press b
+1 release b
+1 press b
+1 release b
+1 press b
+1 release b
until app none 60
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state sealCase.counts[49] 10
+0 assert state flags["platinum:FLAG_RECEIVED_SOLACEON_TOWN_EAST_HOUSE_SEAL_CASE"] true
